{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112249016528539648"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112249040251637894"], "id": "2112249040251637894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1190, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Chaltabagan at 11:52PM. No crowd or ad banners.\n\nHome to three iconic Durga Pujas (Lohapatty, Sarbojanin, Simla).\n\nClose to Hatibagan Nabin Pally, Kashi Bose, Nalin Sarkar, College Square, Santosh Mitra, Shyambazar &amp; Sealdah Station.\n\nPUJA VIBES ARE MISSING BECAUSE OF BJP! https://t.co/ZKD7yShUNJ", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112249040251637894"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097407140016128", "3_2112097407140057088", "3_2112097407182000128", "3_2112097407169437696"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097414836531229"], "id": "2112097414836531229", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📰 NISHAAN makes headlines!\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja’s 84th edition finds a place across the press. Grateful to the journalists sharing our story of faith, art and heritage. 🙏\n\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark https://t.co/R3X70tWnZs", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097414836531229"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097205490528256", "3_2112097205490495488", "3_2112097205448495104", "3_2112097205448499200"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097213392580776"], "id": "2112097213392580776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📰 A mark of faith. A story making headlines.\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja’s 84th edition and “NISHAAN — The Mark” finds a place across the press. 🙏✨\n\nThank you to the publications\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja20d https://t.co/bzz28fW05M", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097213392580776"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111887009405075456", "3_2111887024684933120", "3_2111887044637270016", "3_2111887070134505472"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-18T18:28:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111887088958513154"], "id": "2111887088958513154", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 614, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "#88 Visited Ekdalia. Beautiful pandal and pratima as always. Look at the posture of pratima. That is what sets it apart from the rest. Face, eyes aren't the only things. Look at how mother and rest are sitting. Absolutely stunning. Greatest of South Kolkata for a reason. https://t.co/cfJE7N9sHP", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111887088958513154"}, {"author_id": "1304835685610737665", "created_at": "2026-10-18T14:56:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111833790557605926"], "id": "2111833790557605926", "in_reply_to_user_id": "174285951", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 443, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111825968365273478", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mayukhrghosh People love pujo crowd?? Seriously?? I want to know who those people are!!\n2019 was when I went pandal hopping in Kolkata on Shoptomi. I swore not to do that ever again! Escaped a stampede like situation in ekdalia! Joto rajjer chapri, Bihari crowd rastay!", "url": "https://x.com/Tinniz1/status/2111833790557605926"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111679989943087104", "3_2111680000927956992"]}, "author_id": "420943020", "created_at": "2026-10-18T04:45:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111680018418147478"], "id": "2111680018418147478", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 191, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Major Durga Puja Pandals have been temporarily closed for Public Entry till the Crowd Management and Security Assessment in On after the Chorebagan Stampede Incident that took place last night due to continuos rain and excessive volatile crowd.\n\n🛑 Tala Pratoy\n🛑 Chetla Agrani https://t.co/kIAWePUkrZ", "url": "https://x.com/kumar3798/status/2111680018418147478"}, {"author_id": "803197771389861888", "created_at": "2026-10-17T18:05:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111518921622999095"], "id": "2111518921622999095", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 4719, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "I’m a big-time pandal hopper. Durga Puja evenings are something I look forward to every year. ❤️\n\nToday, I got ready and stepped out to visit Ahiritola, Kumartuli, Chorbagan, Chaltabagan and other nearby pandals.\n\nAfter visiting just two pujas, it started raining. I took a cab", "url": "https://x.com/financialsarthi/status/2111518921622999095"}, {"author_id": "1170441364468830211", "created_at": "2026-10-17T16:42:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111497482039406848", "2111498040070561994", "2111501783784947797"], "id": "2111498040070561994", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 108, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "17 lives lost , still counting and  several injured in a stampede at a Durga Puja pandal  at CHALTABAGAN SARBOJANIN DURGA PUJA in Kolkata. A horrifying testament to the government’s abject failure in crowd management, public safety and administrative accountability.\n\nNever in", "url": "https://x.com/Anika_Breaths/status/2111498040070561994"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111449275335139328"]}, "author_id": "141584822", "created_at": "2026-10-17T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111449653782925485"], "id": "2111449653782925485", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1106, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kolkata, West Bengal: Large numbers of devotees visited Durga Puja pandals across Kolkata on Saptami to offer prayers to Goddess Durga. At Ekdalia Evergreen, the pandal was designed in the style of Gujarat’s iconic Somnath Temple, featuring depictions of Lord Shiva in different https://t.co/5ZwGBcm2lm", "url": "https://x.com/ians_india/status/2111449653782925485"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111084695241064449"]}, "author_id": "1028019548", "created_at": "2026-10-16T13:19:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111084724366290991"], "id": "2111084724366290991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 36, "impression_count": 5186, "like_count": 417, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 110}, "text": "When the rain meets the divine, it’s pure magic. 🔥❤️\n\nHindus in New Bengal are celebrating Maa Durga with full enthusiasm, and even the downpour can’t stop the pandal-hopping at Kolkata’s iconic Bagbazar Sarbojanin… \n\nNothing can dampen Bengal’s Durga Puja spirit! 🙏🚩 https://t.co/3ABfnAcYZD", "url": "https://x.com/Sumita327/status/2111084724366290991"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111048433377378304"]}, "author_id": "3052237998", "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:56:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111048591322275956"], "id": "2111048591322275956", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 408, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "If you're pandal-hopping in Kolkata, how can you miss Bagbazar Durga Puja! A celebration of tradition, heritage and history, Bagbazar is a must-visit during Durga Puja. https://t.co/Txm2JF9q5H", "url": "https://x.com/abirghoshal/status/2111048591322275956"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111041880532365312"]}, "author_id": "85990997", "created_at": "2026-10-16T10:29:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111041893362708811"], "id": "2111041893362708811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 935, "like_count": 94, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Queen’s darshan done! 🙏🏼🥹😇\n\n📍Baghbazar Sarbojanin \n\n#QueenOfKolkata #Kolkata #DurgaPujo #DurgaPuja https://t.co/FmRexXEBwQ", "url": "https://x.com/PantryCar/status/2111041893362708811"}, {"author_id": "1173065271617081344", "created_at": "2026-10-16T08:41:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111014589932699998"], "id": "2111014589932699998", "in_reply_to_user_id": "85990997", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110995376232866192", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PantryCar If you want to do pandal hopping, go to garia, ekdalia side - basically, South Kolkata. North side means, maniktala side, college street etc., don't remember exact spots. Forgot", "url": "https://x.com/RaviVenkatrama5/status/2111014589932699998"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111008022160113664"]}, "author_id": "745524354411159552", "created_at": "2026-10-16T08:18:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111008791777148974"], "id": "2111008791777148974", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 456, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Glimpses from the inauguration of Manicktala Chaltabagan Durga Puja by the Hon’ble Governor of West Bengal, Shri R. N. Ravi.\n @chaltabagan @lokbhavan_wb  @shishirkb @me_locket  @HariMohanBangur @RituparnaSpeaks #TapasRoy https://t.co/fUXid3ytU5", "url": "https://x.com/sundeepbhutoria/status/2111008791777148974"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2111004399330115584", "3_2111004475196649472", "3_2111004603886276608", "3_2111004661151154176"]}, "author_id": "1291675531939700736", "created_at": "2026-10-16T08:14:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111007857827320179"], "id": "2111007857827320179", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 141, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Shri Biswanath Bhansali, DD (MP &amp; SI), NJB visited eco-friendly Durga Puja Pandals (Belgachia Kendriya Sarbojanin Durgotsav &amp; Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatti) made of jute ropes, yarn, fabrics (Kachch Art) &amp; jute fabrics respectively on 16.10.26 to review the extent of jute use. https://t.co/WUJ1jVSiuA", "url": "https://x.com/JuteBoard/status/2111007857827320179"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110946915026358272", "3_2110946915219333120", "3_2110947283881848832", "3_2110947283856756736"]}, "author_id": "1570489236444545027", "created_at": "2026-10-16T04:14:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110947580477874236"], "id": "2110947580477874236", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1280, "like_count": 80, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "Governor Ravi and Smt. Laxmi Ravi had Darshan of Maa Durga and offered Puja, praying for the happiness, good health and prosperity of all and for Her blessings as we work together to build a new, resurgent Bengal and reclaim its historic glory.\nThey joined the Durga Puja https://t.co/hDKH2g5wHR", "url": "https://x.com/lokbhavan_wb/status/2110947580477874236"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110837292822822912", "3_2110837324754092032"]}, "author_id": "1486306992490946567", "created_at": "2026-10-15T20:56:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110837364709118261"], "id": "2110837364709118261", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Like every year, visited the Bagbazaar Sarbojonin Durga Pujo. \nNetaji Subhas Chandra Bose served as the President of the Bagbazar Sarbojanin Durgotsav committee from 1938 to 1939.\nSaw this amazing garlanded statue of Netaji there at the entry. 🙏\n\n#DurgaPuja #Kolkata https://t.co/IxxKlgnTTb", "url": "https://x.com/ArijitM28107122/status/2110837364709118261"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110735844474789888"]}, "author_id": "141584822", "created_at": "2026-10-15T14:14:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110736067616018849"], "id": "2110736067616018849", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 926, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Kolkata, West Bengal: Governor R. N. Ravi, Minister Tapas Roy and BJP leader Locket Chatterjee attended the inauguration ceremony of the Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja pandal. https://t.co/a1FaynoYma", "url": "https://x.com/ians_india/status/2110736067616018849"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110711297495187456", "3_2110711326469447681"]}, "author_id": "2084548793731895296", "created_at": "2026-10-15T12:36:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110711356949397767"], "id": "2110711356949397767", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 398, "like_count": 47, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Baghbazar Sarbojanin Durgotsav is one of Kolkata's oldest and most iconic traditional community Durga Pujas, celebrating its 108th year in 2026...my personal favourite. Visited today morning 🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻 https://t.co/HjQhbzMGvp", "url": "https://x.com/AhanaGhosh27197/status/2110711356949397767"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110615927163342849"]}, "author_id": "822867427277107200", "created_at": "2026-10-15T06:21:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110616963231977716"], "id": "2110616963231977716", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "বাগবাজার সার্বজনীন দুর্গা উৎসবের চতুর্থীর সন্ধ্যায় মন্ডপ উদ্বোধন: সমাজসেবা ও সম্প্রীতির আবহে নবম বর্ষের শুভ সূচনা https://t.co/GLYwJElfSu", "url": "https://x.com/kakdwip/status/2110616963231977716"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110421015482544128", "3_2110421138648248320", "3_2110421137918476288", "3_2110421138845356032"]}, "author_id": "1570489236444545027", "created_at": "2026-10-14T17:25:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110421786508906833"], "id": "2110421786508906833", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1110, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Governor Ravi and Smt. Laxmi Ravi joined countless devotees in offering Puja and having Darshan of Maa Durga, the eternal embodiment of Shakti and the very soul of Bengal, and prayed for the well-being of the sisters and brothers of Bengal and the prosperity of the State.\n\nThey https://t.co/gW0ow6P6PQ", "url": "https://x.com/lokbhavan_wb/status/2110421786508906833"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110405702321942528"]}, "author_id": "1341576373672898561", "created_at": "2026-10-14T16:21:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110405711612280987"], "id": "2110405711612280987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 3909, "like_count": 531, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 30}, "text": "#13 দক্ষিণের রাজরানী সে—Visited the Mighty Queen of our South Calcutta at Ekdalia Evergreen. An absolute brilliance by Padma Shri Sanatan Rudra Pal, this Mother is forever to be my most favourite https://t.co/IsMFhBfJVE", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2110405711612280987"}, {"author_id": "3868003454", "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109912846398271869"], "id": "2109912846398271869", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 63, "impression_count": 4712, "like_count": 108, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109684043096965608", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ", "url": "https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"}, {"author_id": "740846832755052545", "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:12:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109904974893474142"], "id": "2109904974893474142", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1526603809635856384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 110, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109882876057837846", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Amit4Films @Parthib777 @Exoteric_savy I love pandal hopping but physically I’m not very capable. Also I can’t do the all nighter. But manage to see at least 20-30 pandal every year. Start with South. On Chaturthi. Suruchi, Ekdalia, Hindustan park, Tridhara, Deshopriya  and Ballygaunge cultural. the most famous ones.", "url": "https://x.com/RitzyB94/status/2109904974893474142"}, {"author_id": "2257326878", "created_at": "2026-10-13T04:57:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109871060703490112"], "id": "2109871060703490112", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1526603809635856384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 230, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109684043096965608", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Amit4Films Also be wary of the massive crowd surges post Shashthi,that might compel you to remain queued for hours in a single pandal.Try getting the most famous ones checked before if you can.Sreebhumi, Santosh Mitra Square,Ekdalia Evergreen,Tridhara,Mudiali,Bagbazar,etc.All the best :)", "url": "https://x.com/ayash_jaihind/status/2109871060703490112"}], "includes": {"media": [{"height": 2304, "media_key": "3_2112249016528539648", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVA3ShNaEAASL9F.jpg", "width": 4096}, {"height": 804, "media_key": "3_2112097407140016128", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU-tZsOasAA-fNZ.jpg", "width": 757}, {"height": 703, "media_key": "3_2112097407140057088", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU-tZsObUAADhYb.jpg", "width": 927}, {"height": 727, "media_key": "3_2112097407182000128", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU-tZsYbUAAqyQn.jpg", "width": 1049}, {"height": 1040, "media_key": "3_2112097407169437696", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU-tZsVboAAYeX2.jpg", "width": 1286}, {"height": 588, "media_key": "3_2112097205490528256", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU-tN9BbsAAaBos.jpg", "width": 1087}, {"height": 1304, "media_key": "3_2112097205490495488", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU-tN9BbMAAq8NI.jpg", "width": 626}, {"height": 678, "media_key": "3_2112097205448495104", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU-tN83aUAAC4qR.jpg", "width": 1016}, {"height": 638, "media_key": "3_2112097205448499200", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU-tN83aYAAvCAr.jpg", "width": 1260}, {"height": 3264, "media_key": "3_2111887009405075456", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU7uC7laAAAUshA.jpg", "width": 2448}, {"height": 2448, "media_key": "3_2111887024684933120", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU7uD0gaIAAe-cU.jpg", "width": 3264}, {"height": 2448, "media_key": "3_2111887044637270016", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU7uE-1aoAA7Zsu.jpg", "width": 3264}, {"height": 2448, "media_key": "3_2111887070134505472", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU7uGd0bkAALoew.jpg", "width": 3264}, {"height": 1350, "media_key": "3_2111679989943087104", "type": "photo", "url": 